----------------\nSime Darby Property’s Virtual Property Launch Achieves 90% Take-Up for Maya Ara Residences in One Day | Sime Darby Property (https://www.simedarbyproperty.com/press-releases/sime-darby-propertys-virtual-property-launch-achieves-90-take-maya-ara-residences)\nciteturn307search2 [wordlim: 200] Published: 4.9 years ago; Crawled: 3 weeks ago; Maya Ara Residences evokes contemporary and versatile design, with a nod to sustainable living as demonstrated by its GreenRE compliant development.\n\n< NEWS\n\nSime Darby Property’s Virtual Property Launch Achieves 90% Take-Up for Maya Ara Residences in One Day\n\nARA DAMANSARA, 3 NOVEMBER 2021 – No physical launch? No problem. Sime Darby Property Berhad (“Sime Darby Property” or “Company”) proves that it can continue to launch new products and achieve strong take-up rates virtually, just as it does in the physical world.\n\nThe Company held a virtual launch for its latest high-rise product, Maya Ara Residences in Ara Damansara last weekend, successfully achieving a 90% take-up rate. Homebuyers were provided the convenience of following the event via Facebook Live before proceeding to register their purchase seamlessly through Sime Darby Property’s Online Booking System (“OBS”) which was developed in-house.\n\nSime Darby Property Group Managing Director, Dato’ Azmir Merican said that the project attracted great demand even before the launch and is testament to the Company’s credibility in offering in-demand products, at the right locations and price points\n\n“A lot of research went into the making of Maya Ara Residences, to suit the current and future living and lifestyle trends. Homebuyers will be able to design their houses with our customisable fully-furnished package which provide four different interior design themes.”\n\n“This development injects a breath of fresh air to an already established Ara Damansara township, appealing to the younger generation and attracting first-time homebuyers seeking to make a good investment for the future,” he said.\n\nMaya Ara Residences evokes contemporary and versatile design, with a nod to sustainable living as demonstrated by its GreenRE compliant development. The open plan layouts promote ample natural lighting and ventilation, as well as features which promote energy saving and efficient water use.\n\nThe facilities at Maya Ara Residences are designed for multi-purpose use, with a function hall that can be utilised as a co-working space, a game room with a green screen for video shoots, community barbecue area to promote residents’ interactions, gym and so much more. The development is also easily accessible via three major highways and is located near to various amenities and facilities.\n\nCustomers enjoyed an easy and seamless homebuying experience with the in-house developed OBS that allowed them to select and book their units without any hassle. The OBS is the culmination of Sime Darby Property’s digitalisation efforts on the consumer front to ensure consistency in customer engagements during the pandemic and within the new normal.\n\n“Our online booking platform was developed for the convenience of homebuyers and to provide us a better understanding of our customers’ preferences. The knowledge and insight gained is valuable for the Company to strategise future virtual launches,” said Dato’ Azmir.\n\nWith a built-up of 764 sq. ft., Maya Ara Residences’ Types B and B1 feature two bedrooms and two bathrooms, while Type C at 1,055 sq. ft. area has three bedrooms and two bathrooms. Prices start from RM594,800.\n\nStay updated on Sime Darby Property activities and developments at simedarbyproperty.com, Facebook (facebook.com/SimeDarbyProperty), Instagram (instagram.com/SimeDarbyProperty) and the Sime Darby Property Mobile App (available for download via the App Store and Google Play).\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nIntegrated Developments (https://www.simedarbyproperty.com/sites/default/files/2026-04/SDP%20Integrated%20Annual%20Report%20Mobile.pdf)\nciteturn307search11 [wordlim: 200] Published: 5 months ago;   - Maya Ara Residences\nIntegrated Developments\n\n- Ara Damansara, Petaling Jaya\n  - Maya Ara Residences\n  - TRiARA Residences\n  - Andara\n- KL East, Kuala Lumpur\n  - East 57\n  - The Reya\n- Melawati, Ampang Jaya\n  - Park One\n- USJ Heights, Subang Jaya\n- Putra Heights, Subang Jaya\n  - The Serenade\n  - The Residences\n  - Serasi Residences\n  - Damayan Residences\n- SJ7, Subang Jaya\n  - Hype Residences\n- Subang Jaya City Centre, Subang Jaya\n  - Teja Residences\n  - East One Residences\n- Saujana Impian, Kajang\n\nThe Reya, KL East\n\n39--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nJade Hills | Gamuda Land (https://www.gamudaland.com.my/developments/jade-hills)\nciteturn307search3 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: last week; As the largest green park in Kajang, this development also features a full-fledged international school (Eaton International School) along with easy access to a multitude of amenities at Jade Square and its surrounding Kajang town.\n\nImage: Landing Hero Image\n\nImage\n\nType\n\nTownship\n\nLocation\n\nKajang\n\nSize\n\n338 acres\n\nImageVisit Website\n\n# Premier Green Lung of Kajang\n\nJade Hills remains one of Gamuda Land's most thoughtfully crafted townships known for its lush green landscapes and well-managed development. As the largest green park in Kajang, this development also features a full-fledged international school (Eaton International School) along with easy access to a multitude of amenities at Jade Square and its surrounding Kajang town.\n\nA Mature & Sustainable Community\n\nImage: JH-Feature-Jade Square 2.jpg\n\nPlethora of Conveniences & Amenities\n\nImage: JH-Feature-Origami.jpg\n\nPet Friendly Park & Resort Club\n\n# Our Products\n\nLimited Units\n\nImage: thumb project\n\n### Summerwoods\n\nImage: Location\n\nJade Hills, Kajang\n\n* * *\n\nTyp